[stderr] - Prove a duplicate interaction ID returns the recorded prior outcome and
[stderr]   produces no additional durable transition.
[stderr] - Exercise controlled RNG state twice and compare state/event results.
[stderr] - Exercise sequential command handling and a stale-writer fixture without
[stderr]   selecting a browser-storage implementation.
[stderr] - Record GATE-0004 as retained before adding concrete party/content shapes.
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Evidence
[stderr] 
[stderr] Retain contract-test output for invalid, stale, duplicate, deterministic-RNG,
[stderr] and serialized transition cases, plus the public envelope/invariant inventory
[stderr] and the retained GATE-0004 record.
[stderr] 
[stderr] ## Acceptance criteria
[stderr] 
