[stderr] +---
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Objective
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Define original-content-neutral dialogue, quest, tutorial, and campaign-state
[stderr] +rules that make required progression explicit and idempotent. This contract
[stderr] +defines progression mechanics, not story text, presentation, or authored
[stderr] +campaign expression.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Dependencies
[stderr] +
[stderr] +R0004 owns the core command/idempotency contract and R0013 owns scene and
[stderr] +interaction transitions. Their outputs are prerequisites, not transferred
[stderr] +ownership. GATE-0004 remains an implementation gate for authored text, locale,
[stderr] +and content detail; it does not defer this contract's authoring.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Ownership
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- `src/core/campaign/{quest,dialogue,tutorial}*` and
[stderr] +  `tests/core/campaign/quest*`.
[stderr] +- Quest, dialogue, tutorial, predicate, and progression envelopes.
[stderr] +- Shared progression commands and idempotent completion/rejection rules.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Required behaviour
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Represent progression as stable identifiers, explicit states, prerequisites,
[stderr] +and predicates. Validate interaction IDs, expected revisions, state
[stderr] +preconditions, and predicate inputs before completing tutorial or quest steps.
[stderr] +Completion is idempotent: repeating an acknowledged interaction returns its
[stderr] +prior outcome and never repeats a transition, reward, or required-state loss.
[stderr] +Invalid predicates and missing prerequisites reject safely without mutation.
[stderr] +Required campaign progression cannot be bypassed, overwritten, or made
[stderr] +unreachable by optional state.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Web and PWA differences
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Web and PWA adapters render and submit the same shared progression commands.
[stderr] +They may provide presentation-specific onboarding affordances but have no
[stderr] +authority to mark dialogue, tutorial, or quest progress complete. UI flow,
[stderr] +layout, localization rendering, and PWA lifecycle are excluded.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Non-goals
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Do not author story, dialogue, locale strings, characters, branches, user
[stderr] +content, UI, assets, audio, maps, rewards, browser flows, or remote state. Do
[stderr] +not resolve GATE-0004 or select concrete campaign content.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Asset assessment
[stderr] +
[stderr] +`asset_impact` is `not_applicable`: predicate and progression contracts need
[stderr] +no visual/source asset. Do not create or reserve dialogue portraits, maps,
[stderr] +icons, illustrations, fonts, sprites, or any other product asset; `asset_ids`
[stderr] +remains blank.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Audio assessment
[stderr] +
[stderr] +`audio_impact` is `not_applicable`: state transitions neither select nor
[stderr] +trigger music, speech, or sound effects. Keep all audio metadata blank/default
[stderr] +and do not create incidental cues.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Verification
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- Exercise repeated completion through deterministic fixtures and prove it
[stderr] +  returns the acknowledged outcome without an extra transition or reward.
[stderr] +- Prove invalid predicates, missing prerequisites, stale revisions, and unknown
[stderr] +  identifiers reject without state mutation or bypassing required progress.
[stderr] +- Compare metadata, requirements, provenance, dependencies, and ownership to
[stderr] +  IMP-0014 and R0014's manifest allocation; retain GATE-0004 explicitly.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Evidence
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Retain progression state-machine fixture output, idempotency/rejection results,
[stderr] +the manifest/catalogue comparison, and the unresolved GATE-0004 record.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Acceptance criteria
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- Quest and tutorial progression is explicit, predicate-checked, repeat-safe,
[stderr] +  and cannot bypass required campaign state.
[stderr] +- Repeated completion is idempotent and invalid progression commands preserve
[stderr] +  the prior state.
[stderr] +- No authored narrative, locale, UI, asset, or audio work is introduced, and
[stderr] +  GATE-0004 remains visible as an implementation gate.
