README.md-282-| **Catalogue checkpoint (C)** | An internal authoring control that checks the catalogue and allocation ledger before a new writing wave can proceed. It creates no application deliverable. |
README.md-283-| **Dispatcher (D)** | An internal authoring control that creates the next bounded B-series files when more parts of the catalogue still need R runbooks. It creates no application deliverable. |
