+title: Define exploration scene and exit transition contract
+dependencies: R0004,R0005
+requirement_ids: REQ-0002,REQ-0008,NFR-0007
+source_specifications: specification/02-feature-model.md#2-exploration-town-dungeon-and-campaign-content,specification/03-technical-contract.md#data-contract
+source_catalogue_ids: IMP-0013
+authoring_batch: B0007
+factory_stages: F011,F012,F013
+asset_impact: not_applicable
+asset_ids:
+asset_brief: No assets; content-neutral scene and transition contracts.
+audio_impact: not_applicable
